# The plan login of the llm service (headless Claude Code, goal.md 5.10). Copy this file to llm.env (untracked); keep this one line.
# Make the value on the PC with `claude setup-token` (valid one year). Never put an API key or an ANTHROPIC line here: the worker refuses to start.
CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=paste-the-value-from-claude-setup-token
